msgid "Missing PowerDNS tables:"
msgstr "Manglende PowerDNS tabeller:"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:194
msgid "Poweradmin requires these PowerDNS tables to function properly."
msgstr "Poweradmin kræver disse PowerDNS-tabeller for at fungere korrekt."

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:202
msgid "Updating database... done!"
msgstr "Opdatering af database... færdig!"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:224
msgid "Foreign Key Constraint Issues:"
msgstr "Problemer med fremmednøglebegrænsninger:"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:226
msgid ""
"The installer could not remove existing tables due to foreign key constraints"
msgstr ""
"Installationsprogrammet kunne ikke fjerne eksisterende tabeller på grund af "
"fremmednøglebegrænsninger"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:227
msgid ""
"This can happen during reinstallation if you have custom constraints or if "
"tables are referenced by other tables"
msgstr ""
"Dette kan ske under geninstallation, hvis du har brugerdefinerede "
"begrænsninger, eller hvis tabeller er refereret af andre tabeller"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:228
msgid ""
"You can try manually disabling foreign key checks before running the "
"installer:"
msgstr ""
"Du kan prøve manuelt at deaktivere fremmednøglekontrol, før du kører "
"installationsprogrammet:"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:241
msgid "Suggestions:"
msgstr "Forslag:"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:235
msgid "Make sure the SQLite database file exists"
msgstr "Sørg for at SQLite databasefilen eksisterer"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:236
msgid ""
"Check that the web server has read and write permissions for the database "
"file"
msgstr ""
"Kontrollér, at webserveren har læse- og skriverettigheder til databasefilen"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:237
msgid "Verify the full path to the database file is correct and accessible"
msgstr ""
"Kontrollér, at den fulde sti til databasefilen er korrekt og tilgængelig"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:243
msgid "Verify database credentials are correct"
msgstr "Kontrollér, at databaseoplysningerne er korrekte"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:244
msgid "Check that the database user has sufficient privileges"
msgstr "Kontroller, at databasebrugeren har tilstrækkelige privilegier"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:245
msgid "Ensure the database server is running and accessible"
msgstr "Sørg for at databaseserveren kører og er tilgængelig"

